# Cat Carrier (Siamese) from Cookie in the Deadmines.
# Sources: items.json (Cookie, 15% per kill, Classic drop data); the
# Deadmines (18-23) is in Forever; Forever's client data (the carrier does
# not bind, so it can be traded). Donni Anthania does not sell the Siamese in
# Forever's vendor data.

step The Deadmines: Cookie
  tip The Deadmines is a group of five under Moonbrook: the mine mouth is in Moonbrook, the instance portal deep inside the mine. Cookie, the murloc cook, waits on a small island under the pirate ship at the far end, an optional boss; his cooking heals him, so interrupt it. He drops the Siamese about 15% of the time in Classic's data: expect several runs. The carrier can be traded, so check the Auction House too.
  goto 42.5,71.7 live "The Deadmines, in the Moonbrook mine"
  goto 38.0,77.5 "The Deadmines portal, inside the Moonbrook mine"
  collect 8490 @38.0,77.5             -- Cookie
